    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright & Spacious 3-Bedroom Duplex with South-Facing Balcony\r\n\r\n137 Clonmore presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a bright, spacious and exceptionally inviting three-bedroom duplex in the heart of Ardee town. Built in 2005, this large property offers excellent accommodation, an abundance of natural light and the added benefit of two private balconies.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a stairway leads to the first floor, where the accommodation comprises a guest WC, a large kitchen and an adjoining bright living room. The kitchen is particularly impressive, with generous proportions and double doors opening onto a large south-facing balcony extending the full length of the kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe living room benefits from its own balcony overlooking the street allowing plenty of natural light into the room.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of the property is the bright and welcoming staircase and landing area. A large feature window positioned at the turn of the stairs floods the property with natural light and creates a lovely sense of space throughout the home.\r\n\r\nOn the second floor, there are three spacious bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from a private ensuite. A family bathroom completes the accommodation on this level.\r\n\r\n137 Clonmore is a bright, spacious and well-presented duplex offering generous living accommodation in a convenient town-centre location. With its excellent proportions, three spacious bedrooms and fantastic south-facing balcony, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, light and excellent accommodation this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "First Floor\r\nKitchen: 5.02m x 2.73m\r\nLiving Room: 5.02m x 3.75m\r\nGuest WC: 1.61m x 1.41m\r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\nBedroom 1: 4.55m x 2.6m\r\nEnsuite: 2.52m x 0.8m\r\nBedroom 2: 2.87m x 2.28m\r\nBedroom 3: 2.84m x 2.65m\r\nBathroom: 2.61m x 1.72m"
      },
